        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "SDR 规格上限 52 MHz；50 MHz 是建议工作点。",
        "width": 475.02,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
