        "width": 481.21,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "评估 1.8 V I/O；VCC、VCCQ 与电源时序按料号。",
        "width": 482.93,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "实现边界",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "SDR 可评估数字收发 + I/O；仍须完成时序收敛。",
        "width": 480.37,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "HS200/HS400 常需调谐、DLL/延迟线等 PHY 功能。",
        "width": 517.67,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
