        "allocated": 716,
        "size_pt": 17.28
      },
      {
        "text": "工作频率",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "10 MHz 为首次联调建议；100 MHz 为评估目标。",
        "width": 483.87,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "系列标称 STR 最高 166 MHz，不等于系统可达。",
        "width": 475.97,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "时钟前提",
        "width": 88.0,
        "allocated": 124,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "当前 SCK = clk_i / [2 × (CLKDIV + 1)]。",
        "width": 383.84,
        "allocated": 590,
        "size_pt": 15.84
      },
      {
        "text": "100 MHz SCK 要求 clk_i ≥200 MHz 且分频匹配。",
        "width": 487.1,
